    "GroupSerial" : 17656,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Som you're willing to take on this mission!\r\nThe White Guard Knights of late can spare no\r\nhands this way — 'tis a godsend.",
        "Jp" : "退治を引き受けてくれるのね！\r\n最近は白衛騎士団もこちら方面には\r\n手が回っていないようだから、助かるわ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446144,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "[Maritia the Kidnapper] makes her nest in the\r\nPeddler's Peril — partway along the lone path\r\nfrom Lynwood to Mysree Grove.",
        "Jp" : "\"子攫いのメリーティア\"が巣食っているのは\r\nリンウッドからミスリウ森林深部に向かう\r\n一本道の途中にある《行商人の難所》よ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 527313,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Come to think, did you already know of [Maritia\r\nthe Kidnapper]? She's a vicious Nightmare\r\nthat's tasted human flesh.",
        "Jp" : "そういえば、\"子攫いのメリーティア\"のことは\r\nもう知っていたかしら？\r\n人の味を知った凶悪なナイトメアよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 527314,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Once, 'tis said, she flew the length of Lestania,\r\nsnatching and devouring none but children. Heard\r\ntell the Knight's Order had exterminated her...\r\nyet she lurked somewhere, and survived.",
        "Jp" : "かつてはこのレスタニア中を飛び回り\r\n子供ばかりを攫っては食べていたそうよ\r\n騎士団に討伐されたと聞いていたのだけど\r\nどこかに潜んで生き延びていたのね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482109,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When she took wing anew... can't rightly say.\r\nBut t'other day, she came flying from Jingen's\r\ndirection — dread cry and all.",
        "Jp" : "一体いつ頃から活動を再開したのかは\r\nわからないけど\r\n先日、恐ろしい叫び声と共に\r\nジンゲンの方角から飛来したの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482273,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Lynwood has children aplenty — she's surely\r\nmarked the place, lies in wait close by.\r\nWe must act ere a child is snatched—",
        "Jp" : "リンウッドには子供も多いから\r\nきっと目を付けて近くで狙っているに違いないわ\r\n子供が攫われる前に何とかしなきゃ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482153,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1412,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Patricia",
      "Jp" : "パトリシア"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
